vkCmdDraw(): the storage image descriptor [VkDescriptorSet 0xb000000000b, Set 0, Binding 1, Index 0] is accessed by a OpTypeImage that has a Format operand Rgba16ui (equivalent to VK_FORMAT_R16G16B16A16_UINT) which doesn't match the VkImageView 0x150000000015 format (VK_FORMAT_R16G16B16A16_USCALED). Any loads or stores with the variable will produce undefined values to the whole image (not just the texel being accessed). While the formats are compatible, Storage Images must exactly match. Few ways to resolve this are
